]},"favorite_count":870,"favorited":false,"full_text":"【高市総理・所信表明演説（物価高対策）】\n切れ目のない物価高対策として、かつ、中低所得者の皆様の負担を直接軽減するため、「消費税・支援金法案」の準備を進めています。 https://t.co/4sdpGPVrtx","id_str":"2108208411007463723","is_quote_status":false,"lang":"ja","possibly_sensitive":false,"possibly_sensitive_editable":true,"quote_count":4,"reply_count":61,"retweet_count":125,"retweeted":false,"user_id_str":"412940784"},"note_tweet":{"is_expandable":true,"note_tweet_results":{"result":{"entity_set":{"hashtags":[],"smarttags":[],"symbols":[],"timestamps":[],"urls":[{"display_url":"kantei.go.jp/jp/105/stateme…","expanded_url":"https://www.kantei.go.jp/jp/105/statement/2026/1005shoshinhyomei.html","indices":[209,232],"url":"https://t.co/VLOHmIUi7t"}],"user_mentions":[]},"id":"Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIxMDgyMDg0MTA4OTQxNTk4NzI=","richtext":{"richtext_tags":[]},"text":"【高市総理・所信表明演説（物価高対策）】\n切れ目のない物価高対策として、かつ、中低所得者の皆様の負担を直接軽減するため、「消費税・支援金法案」の準備を進めています。\n暮らしに最も近い飲食料品の税負担を軽くし、あわせて、所得に応じた支援金を措置し、家計に少しでも「ゆとり」を生み出したい。そのための法案です。\n\n10月5日に行われた高市総理の所信表明演説の動画及びテキストは、官邸HPに掲載しています。\n▼詳細はこちら\nhttps://t.co/VLOHmIUi7t"}}},"rest_id":"2108208411007463723","unmention_data":{},"views":{"count":"33222","state":"EnabledWithCount"}}}}},"entryId":"tweet-2108208411007463723","sortIndex":"2108317702228541440"},{"content":{"__typename":"TimelineTimelineItem","clientEventInfo":{"component":"suggest_organic_list_tweet","details":{"timelinesDetails":{"injectionType":"OrganicListTweet"}},"element":"tweet"},"entryType":"TimelineTimelineItem","itemContent":{"__typename":"TimelineTweet","itemType":"TimelineTweet","tweetDisplayType":"Tweet","tweet_results":{"result":{"__typename":"Tweet","cashtag_attachments":[],"core":{"user_results":{"result":{"__typename":"User","action_counts":{"favorites_count":2},"affiliates_highlighted_label":{},"avatar":{"image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1082102533454102528/HXpr1ZEl_normal.jpg"},"banner":{"image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/303730149/1791191305"},"core":{"created_at":"Mon May