2472,"favorited":false,"full_text":"【高市総理・所信表明演説（責任ある積極財政）】\n「日本成長戦略」と「地域未来戦略」を両輪に、予算編成方針も大胆に見直し、政府が一歩前に出て、国内投資の呼び水として、大規模かつ長期の、予見可能性の高い財政支出を計画的に行い、大胆な国内投資を力強く引き出していきます。 https://t.co/lnkR6hLEhU","id_str":"2107845144347324850","is_quote_status":false,"lang":"ja","possibly_sensitive":false,"possibly_sensitive_editable":true,"quote_count":23,"reply_count":203,"retweet_count":345,"retweeted":false,"user_id_str":"412940784"},"note_tweet":{"is_expandable":true,"note_tweet_results":{"result":{"entity_set":{"hashtags":[],"smarttags":[],"symbols":[],"timestamps":[],"urls":[{"display_url":"kantei.go.jp/jp/105/stateme…","expanded_url":"https://www.kantei.go.jp/jp/105/statement/2026/1005shoshinhyomei.html","indices":[189,212],"url":"https://t.co/VLOHmIUPX1"}],"user_mentions":[]},"id":"Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIxMDc4NDUxNDQyODQ0MjYyNDA=","richtext":{"richtext_tags":[]},"text":"【高市総理・所信表明演説（責任ある積極財政）】\n「日本成長戦略」と「地域未来戦略」を両輪に、予算編成方針も大胆に見直し、政府が一歩前に出て、国内投資の呼び水として、大規模かつ長期の、予見可能性の高い財政支出を計画的に行い、大胆な国内投資を力強く引き出していきます。\n \n10月5日に行われた高市総理の所信表明演説の動画及びテキストは、官邸HPに掲載しています。\n▼詳細はこちら\nhttps://t.co/VLOHmIUPX1"}}},"rest_id":"2107845144347324850","unmention_data":{},"views":{"count":"63901","state":"EnabledWithCount"}}}}},"entryId":"tweet-2107845144347324850","sortIndex":"2108317702228541356"},{"content":{"__typename":"TimelineTimelineItem","clientEventInfo":{"component":"suggest_organic_list_tweet","details":{"timelinesDetails":{"injectionType":"OrganicListTweet"}},"element":"tweet"},"entryType":"TimelineTimelineItem","itemContent":{"__typename":"TimelineTweet","itemType":"TimelineTweet","tweetDisplayType":"Tweet","tweet_results":{"result":{"__typename":"Tweet","cashtag_attachments":[],"core":{"user_results":{"result":{"__typename":"User","action_counts":{"favorites_count":46},"affiliates_highlighted_label":{},"avatar":{"image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1985639760669655041/3yz_lJbK_normal.jpg"},"banner":{"image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/218434058/1790225212"},"core":{"created